Package: meta-compat-environment
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: The META Project <packages@meta.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/tnuproject/meta
Description: identifies a META compatibility root
 Marks this Debian userland as a META compatibility root running on a FreeBSD
 kernel, and prevents APT from installing kernels, bootloaders and init systems,
 which have no function there.
